== uniform-measure GoE: theory ==
 GoE states are non-fixed (fixed points are their own predecessor);
 non-fixed fraction = 1 - F(m)/2^(27m) ~= m * 2^-27  (Task 1, exact).
 So under the uniform measure the reachable set has full measure:
 GoE fraction <= m * 7.45e-9.  Irreversibility is a SPARSE-sector affair.

